      en: ["The terminal possesses a storage capacity of several million liters.", "It serves as the primary supply point for the Berbera Corridor into Ethiopia.", "The facility was originally established with technical support from the USSR.", "Modern fire suppression and safety systems were recently integrated.", "Fuel is distributed from this site via tanker trucks to all regions of Somaliland.", "The terminal is a cornerstone of the country's national energy security."],
